{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2013-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1387152000, "end_date": 1387843199, "month_true_total": 1420, "quota": 13, "returned": 13, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:07:49 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "8236820", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037907812", "personaname": "BT | Testudo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198037907812/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1363, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 932, "last_played": 1551462647, "avatar": "9b759e6f1a85a3048625ea5471664b15b965bed1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty good, I like it.", "timestamp_created": 1387839536, "timestamp_updated": 1387839536, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.456431567668914795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8236635", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991155815", "personaname": "MercurialConstruct", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hydrargyrumlucca/", "num_games_owned": 339, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3488, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2151, "last_played": 1682737199, "avatar": "f50e66fd6a7911936a6ca4fddfacc305732b024e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Woot! Having a ton of fun with this game so far. It's fast, frantic and completely chaotic at times. Since the game's difficulty scales with time spent versus character level, it forces you to keep up your pace or risk falling beneath the power level of the monsters. One of my only complaints for this game is it can become difficult to tell what's happening when particularly large groups of monsters (or groups of particularly large monsters!) and attack animations are going off. \n\nDefinately the sort of game that you can play in a half-hour stint, or a four hour binge. There is a large variety of meta-game unlockables (including new items to find in-game and new classes) that keeps you wanting one more round.\n\n Co-op is tons of fun as well! Local works perfectly, and while I ran into a few (mostly minor graphical) issues with the online co-op it was still incredibly fun and didn't detract much from the experience. Recommend!\n8.5/10\nPros:\n-Multiple difficulty settings for rookies to vets\n-Unique unlockable character classes\n-Crisp, fast-paced action\n-Play alone! Play split-screen with friends beside you! Play online with friends everywhere!\n-Cool soundtrack/art style... + explosions\n\n\nCons\n-Minor issues with online co-op\n-Action can become obscured by... the action", "timestamp_created": 1387838989, "timestamp_updated": 1390282066, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.570459663867950439", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8235878", "author": {"steamid": "76561197987336418", "personaname": "Draco Obscura", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197987336418/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 6189, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2899, "last_played": 1441682005, "avatar": "688c4b5a629931869d7bf3fdf47dd8d3bf72e61c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is amazing", "timestamp_created": 1387836796, "timestamp_updated": 1387836796, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8234863", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070168657", "personaname": "Ebbe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ebb_and_flow/", "num_games_owned": 425, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2809, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1898, "last_played": 1700223280, "avatar": "5c01263e02d3cff0173ecfc9fea5595f1842c27f"}, "language": "english", "review": "The best game I have ever played, this game completed destroyed me at first, its difficulty was astounding, this may sound like a bad thing but it isn't. It provides a massive challenge that you feel compelled to beat, the soundtrack inspires that motivation and pushes you to see what the next stage is like. The timer creates a wonderful set of tactics not seen in many other games. You must beat the timer whilst also avoiding being underpowered for the boss and the next level's other enemies which for new players is near impossible. The game gives you the best feeling when you complete it, I raised my hands and cheered when I beat the final boss. This is a brilliant game and I absolutely recommend it to anyone, well worth the price.", "timestamp_created": 1387833818, "timestamp_updated": 1387833818, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8234679", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991307093", "personaname": "Mr.Fox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197991307093/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4231, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1492, "last_played": 1534883776, "avatar": "990d6617c40cb5ff16eda0a6ec5b4abeeeac9e0c"}, "language": "english", "review": "My new drug.", "timestamp_created": 1387833372, "timestamp_updated": 1387833372, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8234607", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994041636", "personaname": "Slaad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994041636/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2078, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1600, "last_played": 1388612775, "avatar": "8c16e1d95fd4a51fec92e90bf9709f54ce876b41"}, "language": "english", "review": "Worth every penny!", "timestamp_created": 1387833218, "timestamp_updated": 1387833218, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500011324882507324", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8233835", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005271335", "personaname": "Pale Dolphin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198005271335/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 201, "playtime_forever": 349, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 332, "last_played": 1591452424, "avatar": "7483d5df078ffee1cdb262c90417d2b089c7a396"}, "language": "english", "review": "Insanely addictive platformer with a lot of rogue-like mechanics. Even though the graphics does look bland at the first sight, the game mechanics are flawless. Replayability is extremely high (local and online co-op included): there's a lot of unlockables, such as new boosts, new playable characters (possibly, a lot more than that, but I'm just getting started playing the game). The levels are generated randomly each time you start a new game, which increases replayability furthermore. Absolutely worth it's money. I'd rate this game 9.0 / 10.0.", "timestamp_created": 1387831243, "timestamp_updated": 1387831243, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.585336625576019287", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8232973", "author": {"steamid": "76561197962684965", "personaname": "Chrysippus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/APChrysippus/", "num_games_owned": 1425, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 72, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 72, "last_played": 1387843831, "avatar": "6f1857e15c7ab52dd9a2f773ed9ad885c1aaa5e1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pixely, platforming madness. Pretty darn hard, but a lot of fun. I suggest a controller.", "timestamp_created": 1387829018, "timestamp_updated": 1387829018, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8232615", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053585327", "personaname": "Slepice1", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/slepice1/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1861, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 337, "last_played": 1430760443, "avatar": "ca11300781b6425ed6f91911ced33780398cd8b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Super rogue-like platformovka, ale na klávesnici se to hraje blbě (a to na klávesnici hraju 98% věcí) zatím jsem sice ovladač nezkoušel ale určitě to bude lepší.\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1387828102, "timestamp_updated": 1387828102, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8231716", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044484619", "personaname": "PJvsTheWorld", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044484619/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 803, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 164, "last_played": 1414516863, "avatar": "6d1d929e415e77f9cff285af0a0b1748ae5b26ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "i can barely get past level 2. still fun as hell", "timestamp_created": 1387826018, "timestamp_updated": 1387826018, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8231595", "author": {"steamid": "76561198050860192", "personaname": "thedukenator", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thedukenator/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4506, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 440, "last_played": 1690397770, "avatar": "c72353ba69e263fc61a4e8a1e8f696799edbcf68"}, "language": "english", "review": "its mad good yo", "timestamp_created": 1387825742, "timestamp_updated": 1387825742, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8230402", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976559738", "personaname": "Archdale", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/archdale/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 2250, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 900, "last_played": 1646622616, "avatar": "c0b3f8ff4b5a3efaf64ddf59f94cf1ddae913fbc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game that keeps you playing.  While single player is fun(and required for some unlocks), its best with friends.  With so many classes and power-ups, you'll keep playing and playing, even after you finished the game.  \n\nI recommend using a controller, as that's how I've been playing and enjoying it.", "timestamp_created": 1387823166, "timestamp_updated": 1387823166, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8230353", "author": {"steamid": "76561198107818367", "personaname": "goobie snoobert", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/baconrath/", "num_games_owned": 431, "num_reviews": 117, "playtime_forever": 476, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 248, "last_played": 1451443076, "avatar": "f13416c5e4d8f1b84e7e8f50d81ed89f79f73189"}, "language": "english", "review": "1. Do you often lament kids being on your lawn and games these days being too easy?\n2. Do you like dying in video games? Like, a lot?\n3. Are 8-bit style GRAFIX totally your bag...baby?\n4. Do you like making your enemies bleed, catch on fire and/or explode (etc.) upon death?\n5. Can you handle a game that tells you it \"Sucks to Suck\" upon game over?\n6. Are you okay with a bit of RNG and procedural generated shenanigans?\n7. Do you like somewhat situational and at times difficult achievements that are at the mercy of said RNG/procedural generation?\n8. Have you ever zigged when you should have zagged?\n9. Have you ever wanted to kill a a vast amount of space alligator people in the name of survival?\n\nIf you said \"yes\" or \"a pox on your mailman!\" to one or more of the above you should try Risk of Rain!\n\nEdit: Also there's a Co-Op mode :)\nEdit: As of now the Steam overlay with this game is sketchy so  notifications appear twice, one being normal sized and another being DISTRACTINGLY HUGE. fix this pls :'(\n\n(I would recommend a gamepad for this one.)", "timestamp_created": 1387823058, "timestamp_updated": 1387870425, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}